    "certs": "AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner\nVMware vSphere 6.7 Foundations\nVMware Certified Professional - Data\nCenter Virtualization 2020Taha Hachicha\nCloud Platform Engineer chez Linedata\nGouvernorat Ariana, Tunisie\nExpérience\nLinedata\n8 ans 6 mois\nCloud Platform Engineer\nmars 2021 - Present  (5 ans)\nSenior Systems Administrator Specialist\nseptembre 2017 - février 2021  (3 ans 6 mois)\nTunisia\n• Managing onsite Vmware Infrastructure vSphere 6.0 installation,\nconfiguration, and \ntroubleshooting vCenter and ESXi hosts.\n• Deploying virtual machines, managing vMotion, Distributed Resource\nScheduling (DRS), High \nAvailability (HA) function through vCenter, Snapshots and Capacity planning\nfor VM resource \nallocation.\n• Automation: Working with System Center Orchestrator and Service Manager:\ndevelop some \npowershell scripts to automate IT tasks.\n• Assigning LUNs to ESXi hosts from storage and configuring Datastores.\n• HPE BladeSystem c7000 Enclosures management\n• Storage Administration/Management EMC Storage VNX 5300 / HPE Nimble\n• Administration and monitoring of Datacenter-class hardware (storage arrays,\nservers, etc.) and its \nmaintenance.\n• SQL administration (installs/database backups-restores/permissioning of\ndatabases\n• Network and system administrator (Servers, computers, security, remote\naccess, shared spaces,  \ntechnical support…)\n•       Setup, implement and manage EMC NetWorker Backup  used to backup\non-premise infrastructure .\n•       Support and maintain Microsoft cloud solutions such as Office 365, Intune\nand Azure.\n  Page 1 of 3\n   \n•  Configure, Support and maintain Windows Server Services including\nMicrosoft Active Directory, GPO, \nDNS, DHCP, RAS, RDG, ADFS, WSUS Azure AD connect, SSO, CA.\n•  Configuration and Administration of Microsoft Office 365, Exchange 2016,\nand Lync server.\n• Maintain and develop end-user and administrator documentation of\ninfrastructure.\n• Support end user and Identifies, diagnoses, provide resolution related to\nsoftware, hardware and network \nissues.\nSunGard - now part of FIS\nSystem Administrator\ndécembre 2015 - août 2017  (1 an 9 mois)\n• Monitoring (Nagios, Centreon).\n• Design, implement, troubleshoot, analyze, maintain and monitor the IT\nInfrastructure of a production environment hosting 24x7 services;  server\nadministration, virtualization, network connectivity and utilization\n• Scripting :VBScript, PowerShell, Perl\n• Setup authentication systems (LDAP/Radius/802.1x)\n• Unix and windows patching\n• Network Administration and tro"
